, universities, enterprise campuses, sports venues, themed entertainment, and hospitality sectors through system integrators. It offers its products and solutions under the Atrius, Distech Controls, and QSC brands. Acuity Inc. was formerly known as Acuity Brands, Inc. and changed its name to Acuity Inc. in March 2025. Acuity Inc. was incorporated in 2001 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","employees":13900,"website":"https://www.acuityinc.com","country":"United States","city":"Atlanta","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Neil M. Ashe","title":"Chairman, President & CEO"},{"name":"Ms. Charlotte  McLaughlin","title":"Vice President of Investor Relations"},{"name":"Ms. April Johnson Appling","title":"Senior Vice President of Corporate Marketing & Communications"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.75,"tpe":26.36,"ps":2.156,"pfcf":26.62,"peg":1.4,"pb":3.514,"ev_ebitda":14.88,"rev_growth":0.11,"eps_growth":0.176,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1441,"eps_growth_next":0.1459,"div_yield":0.0066,"roe":0.149,"roa":0.05825,"de":66.95,"gross_margin":0.3185,"op_margin":0.1262,"profit_margin":0.0723,"current_ratio":1.665},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":13.84,"sector":17.75,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":18.95,"sector":26.36,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":2.084,"sector":2.156,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":16.55,"sector":26.62,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.71,"sector":1.4,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":3.226,"sector":3.514,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":27.2,"sector":66.95,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.029,"sector":0.11,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":0.557,"sector":0.176,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","label":"EPS growth (this year, est.)","v":0.0748,"sector":0.1441,"verdict":"Weak"},{"k":"eps_growth_